        <mxCell id="gzaMjMgBlcGmAvIVdbxi-28" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;All outputs default to 0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Fetch dispatch uses Mem_Output[15:13]; IR is loaded at the end of DECODE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;and is stable in every subsequent state&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Memory read has 1 clock latency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PC_value = PC + 1 (adder output)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Immediate is sign-extended (or shifted, for LUI) in the datapath&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Register file forces R0 = 0 on all reads&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;PC and IR initialized via VHDL signal initializers&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
